     2853        if mFrameView
     2854        then do:
     2855           HIDE FRAME InfoFrame.
     2856        end.
     2857     End.
     2858   END.
     2859   assign v-account = ( if integer( 1 ) = 0 then 100 else integer( 1 ) ).
