     3174         .
     3175       end.
     3176       for each buf_ot-line no-lock
     3177         where buf_ot-line.doc-code     = buf_trn-doc.doc-code
     3178           and buf_ot-line.artic        = buf_doc-line.artic
     3179           and buf_ot-line.prod-type    = buf_doc-line.prod-type
     3180           and buf_ot-line.prod-code    = buf_doc-line.prod-code
     3181           and buf_trn-doc.ext-doc-type = 'ee':U
     3182       :
